<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Modern Control Engineering">
  <data key="d0">Modern Control Engineering</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Modern Control Engineering is a textbook designed for senior engineering students, focusing on the analysis and design of control systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Modern Control Engineering is a textbook focusing on control systems, authored by Katsuhiko Ogata.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b35514fc2c12b146cf119eef1af31c06&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6772221556c17af33ecd85904f8b357</data>
