  <data key="d0">Katsuhiko Ogata</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Katsuhiko Ogata is the author of the book on control systems, providing comprehensive treatments of control theories.&lt;SEP&gt;Katsuhiko Ogata is the author of the textbook 'Modern Control Engineering', known for his contributions to control systems education.</data>
