<node id="Prentice Hall">
  <data key="d0">Prentice Hall</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Prentice Hall is a publisher known for publishing 'Linear Optimal Control' and 'Modern Control Theory.'&lt;SEP&gt;Prentice Hall is a publishing company known for releasing numerous important texts in control systems and engineering.&lt;SEP&gt;Prentice Hall is a publishing company that produces educational books and resources, particularly in the fields of engineering and technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Prentice Hall is a publishing company that produces educational materials, particularly in the fields of engineering and technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Prentice Hall is the publishing company responsible for the publication of 'Modern Control Engineering'.</data>
