<node id="MATLAB">
  <data key="d0">MATLAB</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">MATLAB is a high-performance programming platform developed by The Mathworks, Inc., widely used by engineers and scientists for numerical computing, data analysis, visualization, and system modeling in engineering and scientific research. It serves as both a software environment and a high-level programming language, facilitating computational tasks and simulations, particularly in control systems analysis and design. MATLAB provides extensive capabilities for matrix manipulations, plotting functions and data, implementing algorithms, and creating user interfaces. It is commonly employed for generating Bode diagrams, Nyquist plots, Nichols plots, and root-locus plots, as well as for solving mathematical problems like unit-step responses and transient-response analysis. MATLAB also supports transformations between transfer functions and state-space equations, and offers tools like the Control Systems Toolbox for advanced system analysis. Its interactive environment and case-sensitive nature make it a versatile tool for algorithm development and technical computing, often utilized for deriving transfer functions, performing matrix operations, and analyzing system frequency responses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9f0dfc9266a7cbf0daf9292867c654cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8c47160042a9398aa709e25eded3b0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-420f00ddead05e80938b75e022567c58&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-37550db7b78b6550ac3a1bbeaf90fe63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d34b551b0c812125805bc0bfa51cbbdb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f99b64d34db6511197d521a024a4930&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e2b99b1fba82887a0642921f14532a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c1c7e149cb37d4947fe26456e62a591&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-855e35313c15abd36b6e1671061bc057&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ea5a2f30b2dcfbbb586c6854279bee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ab453e611d8eb756961ea34b36c8dd8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f3c134e307adcb9587e648683f4f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6ca112b8faa4912569729a8f7b8746c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a104cc76c4ded119be1e066101146986&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1cfae784926f0c2b91ee587d149b8b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5cb3f412352d8203e1efad181e8a8650&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c51a48b42789ee6452aabf9684ca8e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e2d5c8521bc1f35d5a5daaf0b7fe7eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a59bbd3f86b4923fd22b10788ad73d53&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2172726751d3bb09e7c6c3c9d2e73db9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0477d9985a7d5b2045fb80504b1c802a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-862057e40203dab14f5b486a9fcc1a5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af7ba33d6c623a912a3380defbe28756&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ece149736a8793b07c50dccb1028cee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d179610b2c623234f00bb642b238054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e4ced27e2780342dd0d29aa11c621b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58531aa8deb3e186c6997e9b42da144f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a35e7b410420b5623c1fd33526a3e9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-45d58fa0ad7e2ced2585b4512c2f59e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb2f374d1a1fada7677f9980d7c9fe7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62f88176acf0b93c66f5a8735ba14f56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d25f3afc6ec15e59ee641a894432f365&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf4e759f85cb69aeac07e60c7ccbf414&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c59263c3980c23b4b65459cfd0557ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-04a1c0b94bb767b480f265211df2d3c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8a3a4cd5f5a625120a672d9302619e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e3282077e1fe73808ab0efe43eaa3b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-576041b0bc4054622300c536ef926759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0b45e8c05ce6d6a2e33cb4a65bc30d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b79361c4f9b3077dd7e1175a33749008&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72d535e84ba337e68