<node id="Differential Equation System">
  <data key="d0">Differential Equation System</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A differential equation system consists of equations that describe the relationship between functions and their derivatives.&lt;SEP&gt;A differential equation system involves equations that include derivatives of functions, often used to model dynamic systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical system represented by a third-order differential equation, involving variables and coefficients for state and output equations.</data>
