<node id="Transfer Function System">
  <data key="d0">Transfer Function System</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A transfer function system describes the relationship between the input and output of a system in the Laplace domain.&lt;SEP&gt;A transfer function system is a mathematical representation of the relationship between the input and output of a system.&lt;SEP&gt;Transfer function system is a representation of a system's input-output relationship in the frequency domain, often used in control theory.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb63a19b57948f30bda30ff5517c1eba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-80377cf40599b7bb019354876db314d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fdf618f95ac183086f742904f0c8d6</data>
