<node id="Singular Value Decomposition (SVD)">
  <data key="d0">Singular Value Decomposition (SVD)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Singular value decomposition is a mathematical technique used to factorize a matrix into three distinct matrices, often used in signal processing and statistics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-180f42dfceafd3c905e78519e41eebca</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
