  <data key="d2">Num and Den are arrays used in MATLAB to represent the numerator and denominator of a transfer function.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-180f42dfceafd3c905e78519e41eebca</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
