  <data key="d0">MATLAB Program 2-3</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">MATLAB Program 2-3 refers to a specific computational tool or script used to produce transfer functions for systems in control engineering.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b1e646fef80acb88f1ef990e507e7d48</data>
