<node id="Matrix B">
  <data key="d0">Matrix B</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Matrix B is a crucial component in the state-space representation of control systems, primarily used to define how inputs affect the system's state dynamics. It serves as the input matrix in the state equation, indicating the influence of control inputs on the system. Matrix B is involved in various applications, such as observer design, controllability analysis, and state feedback gain computation. In the context of MATLAB programming, Matrix B is employed for computational purposes, matrix operations, and analysis, often appearing as a two-dimensional array with integer values. It is also used in mathematical proofs and optimal control equations, highlighting its versatility in different control system scenarios. Despite some conflicting descriptions regarding its dimensions, Matrix B is generally considered a vector or matrix that represents input effects in system dynamics equations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-45d58fa0ad7e2ced2585b4512c2f59e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2bf8d3735dca25672b127e3b08be5b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e25465698e9728fefd91973fb2caccd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7901b85c41f86e4c8c10a0b273e9c765&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f805ff2e429256924500b3bb528e1bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e87750a7956fffd621ae63f70162b51a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4f9bb3635034fef2739f071dc807bf7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-193a843542d1b083c02404daa115957e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e036712f5b53112186f8d26bf732a1a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27adbbe8c3daf01de8b63ffa252de1e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-040d64011f55ec07f471f024c2b1be29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8288442d2392d765b02cbc791d1b5378&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8185f3f5e2ea2ff5f1955f91117943ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cc628802fecc6640ad03f377ce29869&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c002c8164af0baaf62d1b67662dbbda4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1779b26d10c1b1abb7d91ca4e5524e77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a587ec6eec2d51c833758323b1607ad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f3c134e307adcb9587e648683f4f4b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-016ebe44f8f410b4e420081ccf7a65f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0279e47752e3eff4e78f68ce4e1c721f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4413c8298743c78468e47ffbe0e228a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e2680709d2b529eb353b1601aca0714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54fdf618f95ac183086f742904f0c8d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7abd7647d540dcfe486743c3fa15b49c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-292c92c504fb43e76a57c3f50454fcbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be8a262c59d580a999bcba6b1211d485&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44fa931a2a4a572fbb711636672bfbd1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd576c10a0963ba5c33eef163a461a22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5e9c5e918d686131ecabed119aa3d7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86ce58db4d75e50b5241f0be0e62c4c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1db318b25ae401b0bef5ad1a5d9a160&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e0212ccf3d9b6dc7dff4b33d16a1ae9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6daa8560d2825569846748debe43a15&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-da505be49d4d9c37eb80545921311479&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d634460bf0500e11bc074875672732ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ece149736a8793b07c50dccb1028cee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3402b465fcfb648982e49c37a455c189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a707fa18fd529fe3c1718e4570e7abb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5b38ba15c11c9500daafd6a0fa68942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8fb07569a4fb35322f960ef1bd2a2a89&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5f8bc3750c711a5de6e8037c4fda4c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9be306b73353043a81456867d4cbe302&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-317307fe0a6ea411ad5662cfe25988d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f55b04c74c20ff1394ec57c53c60a408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44eac93ed1140b2ebd184fa97d308f66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58531aa8deb3e186c6997e9b42da144f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba9e6dce047704f9bd794f5f4ed1e2a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d64c265c70a4b363e906e1040d781b2b</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
