  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Laplace domain is a mathematical representation used for continuous-time systems, often employed in signal processing and control systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Laplace domain is a mathematical representation used in control systems to describe the behavior of signals and systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c0b45e8c05ce6d6a2e33cb4a65bc30d4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a273a3722c026cffba1fca5be00c72f3</data>
