<node id="Numerator Coefficients">
  <data key="d0">Numerator Coefficients</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Numerator Coefficients are part of the MATLAB code defining the numerator of a transfer function in system analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Numerator coefficients are part of the mathematical expressions used to define the transfer function of a system, impacting its response characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;Numerator coefficients are part of the mathematical representation of transfer functions, returned as a matrix in MATLAB.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-400e4b0a84de7cb82216914ca205adc9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f90ff0e91c9dc075f3521e774137ba02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f3c134e307adcb9587e648683f4f4b0</data>
