  <data key="d2">Matrix NUM is used in MATLAB to store numerator coefficients for transfer functions corresponding to system outputs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0f3c134e307adcb9587e648683f4f4b0</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
