  <data key="d0">Springs in Parallel</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Springs in parallel are a configuration where multiple springs are connected side by side, affecting the equivalent spring constant.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a99de50670eed69da300e8009547bd36</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
