  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An operational amplifier (op-amp) is a type of electronic amplifier used to amplify voltage signals, often used in sensor circuits and filters.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational Amplifier is a device used in electronic circuits, mentioned in relation to control systems.</data>
