<node id="Inverting Amplifier">
  <data key="d0">Inverting Amplifier</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An inverting amplifier is an op-amp configuration where the input signal is applied to the inverting terminal, producing an output that is the inverted amplified signal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0c9880f98c8d7623b2a11ce706897bd2</data>
