  <data key="d0">Ideal Op-Amp</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An ideal operational amplifier is a theoretical model of an op-amp with infinite input impedance, zero output impedance, and infinite gain.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0c9880f98c8d7623b2a11ce706897bd2</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
