  <data key="d2">A high-pass filter allows signals with frequencies higher than a certain cutoff frequency to pass through, while attenuating lower frequencies.&lt;SEP&gt;A high-pass filter is a configuration designed to allow low-frequency signals to pass while attenuating higher frequencies.</data>
