  <data key="d2">A component used to reverse the sign of a signal in an operational amplifier circuit, with a transfer function of -R4/R3.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sign Inverter is a component in control systems that reverses the sign of the input signal.&lt;SEP&gt;The Sign Inverter is part of the circuit diagram that includes resistors and capacitors for signal inversion in the compensator.</data>
