  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A capacitor in the operational amplifier circuit that influences the input impedance and dynamics of the circuit.&lt;SEP&gt;Capacitor C1 is an electrical component with a capacitance value of 1 Farad, connected to the positive terminal of the voltage source.</data>
