  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Suspension System refers to the system in vehicles designed to absorb shocks and maintain contact with the road.&lt;SEP&gt;The Suspension System is a mechanical setup involving masses and springs used to study vibrations, oscillations, and harmonic motion.</data>
