  <data key="d0">Op-Amp Circuit</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The op-amp circuit is a basic electronic configuration with resistive and capacitive elements, used for signal processing applications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5df7e896b70c3eb7634619fc0cc39c79</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
