  <data key="d0">Impedance Approach</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The impedance approach is a method used to obtain the transfer function of an op-amp circuit, focusing on the relationship between input and output signals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-eae6e7cf7c375d236da8e4fd6f746d02</data>
