  <data key="d0">Equation (4–30)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation (4–30) relates the displacement of the power piston to the flow rate of oil in hydraulic systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f3d0206ddf0a9d09a9dfc373b545bef</data>
