<node id="Heat Exchanger">
  <data key="d0">Heat Exchanger</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A device designed to efficiently transfer heat between two liquids, featuring components such as cold liquid input, heater, mixer, and hot liquid output.&lt;SEP&gt;A heat exchanger is a device that transfers heat from one fluid to another, consisting of components like an inlet, outlet, and heater.&lt;SEP&gt;The heat exchanger is a device that facilitates the mixing of cold and hot liquids to maintain a constant temperature of the mixed fluid.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a081030b2e96d508f9daac35a26c2be8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0cf05f458c91801bb85a25015c81170&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1897ad76eeb7398a9874d0d8978aa7c</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
