  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A measure of a material's ability to resist the flow of heat.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermal Resistance is a property that measures a material's resistance to heat flow.&lt;SEP&gt;Thermal resistance is a measure of the resistance to heat flow, expressed in °C sec/kcal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a081030b2e96d508f9daac35a26c2be8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76155cfacd298ba99866d06587bc0e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f0cf05f458c91801bb85a25015c81170</data>
