  <data key="d2">Hydraulic systems involve the use of fluid power to perform work and are compared with pneumatic systems for their advantages and disadvantages.&lt;SEP&gt;The hydraulic system depicted in the diagram is designed to regulate fluid flow using valves and pipes, with pressure and flow rate dynamics illustrated.&lt;SEP&gt;The hydraulic system is a mechanical system discussed in the document, involving fluid dynamics and force balance equations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e8fbd6e1853dfec68a3d5baf7fb35d91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d427a9d59bf3e814fd05720d1b33d0f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62a1cbf10c33f82d65ca8e2a6d86b67b</data>
