  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A component located at the top left of the mechanical system diagram, labeled 'P', indicating fluid movement.&lt;SEP&gt;A pump is responsible for creating high-pressure fluid that drives the motor in a hydraulic servomotor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Pump is a device responsible for generating pressure in the hydraulic system, facilitating the movement of oil.&lt;SEP&gt;The pump is a component that creates high-pressure fluid to drive the motor in the servomotor system.</data>
