  <data key="d2">The Top Section of the image contains mathematical equations and graphs related to systems dynamics, focusing on the relationship between maximum peak amplitude (M_p), damping ratio (ζ), and the transfer function of a second-order system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-810cac8c012efc35656f6fae67fff21c</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
