  <data key="d0">Equation (5–24)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An equation representing the transfer function of a servo system with velocity feedback, showing how system parameters affect output.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf32671a4ee19f2726367a3b3826926</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Gain (K)">
  <data key="d0">Gain (K)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A parameter in the servo system that affects the system's response and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;The gain is a factor that influences the amplitude of the output signal, found to be 10 in this analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f4c46665e037287407ddbff2463962aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caf32671a4ee19f2726367a3b3826926</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Velocity-Feedback Constant (K_h)">
  <data key="d0">Velocity-Feedback Constant (K_h)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A constant used to adjust the velocity feedback in the servo system to control the damping ratio.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-caf32671a4ee19f2726367a3b3826926</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
