  <data key="d0">Equation (5–21)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation (5–21) is used to calculate the damping ratio, ζ, in the context of a second-order system's impulse response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1b12ce7d358a5298c40691eca86f278</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
