  <data key="d0">Equation (5–20)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation (5–20) relates the peak time, tp, to the damped natural frequency, ωd, in a second-order system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1b12ce7d358a5298c40691eca86f278</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Equation (5–25)">
  <data key="d0">Equation (5–25)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation (5–25) is used to calculate the coefficient Kh in the context of damping and system response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c1b12ce7d358a5298c40691eca86f278</data>
