  <data key="d0">Equation</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation refers to mathematical expressions used to describe the relationships and dynamics within the system.&lt;SEP&gt;The equation relates to the system's transfer function or mathematical representation in the plot.</data>
