<node id="Inverse Laplace Transform">
  <data key="d0">Inverse Laplace Transform</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A mathematical operation that converts a function from the frequency domain back to the time domain.&lt;SEP&gt;Inverse Laplace Transform is a mathematical operation used to convert a function from the Laplace domain back to the time domain.&lt;SEP&gt;Inverse Laplace Transform is the process of converting algebraic equations back into differential equations, often to find time-domain solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;The process of converting a function in the Laplace domain back to the time domain.</data>
