<node id="Control System Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Control System Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Control system analysis involves studying and designing systems using mathematical methods like the root-locus method.&lt;SEP&gt;Control system analysis is the study and evaluation of the performance and stability of control systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a5f65ec7a6f616b6865aa6c974202119&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c2f0b2bf0954cb3d23352a1767704ce</data>
