<node id="Rouths Stability Criterion">
  <data key="d0">Rouths Stability Criterion</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A method used to determine the stability of a system by examining the coefficients of the Routh array.&lt;SEP&gt;Routh’s Stability Criterion is a mathematical method used to determine the stability of a linear control system by analyzing the roots of its characteristic equation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bb690227c0aeb29078796de6d1611d85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3d1f90ecef2ea0c231698609f06418</data>
