  <data key="d0">Control-System Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Control-System Analysis involves evaluating and improving the performance and stability of control systems, often using mathematical methods like Routh’s Stability Criterion.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f3d1f90ecef2ea0c231698609f06418</data>
