<node id="Output Signal C(s)">
  <data key="d0">Output Signal C(s)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">C(s) is the output signal generated by the signal flow system after processing.&lt;SEP&gt;C(s) is the output signal of the control system, assumed to be constant at 1.&lt;SEP&gt;Output Signal C(s) is the result of the input signal after passing through the system's components, reflecting the processed signal.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-094d0f53918a4b57661980c588c5dd88&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0948b1e428ea01364b1b1ec1955431f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bde48fe7be57bee4bb18f23aaf9bf6a0</data>
