<node id="Force-Time Graph">
  <data key="d0">Force-Time Graph</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A graph depicting the force applied to the spring-mass system over time, showing a linear increase followed by an exponential decrease.&lt;SEP&gt;The force-time graph depicts the linear increase of force with time, reaching a maximum and then decreasing exponentially.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-204404dff5633144a45a65a52892839a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bde48fe7be57bee4bb18f23aaf9bf6a0</data>
