  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A graph illustrating the displacement of the mass in the spring-mass system over time, indicating oscillations around the equilibrium position.&lt;SEP&gt;The displacement-time graph illustrates the changes in displacement of the block over time, showing initial rapid increase followed by oscillations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-204404dff5633144a45a65a52892839a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bde48fe7be57bee4bb18f23aaf9bf6a0</data>
