  <data key="d0">Mechanical Vibratory System</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Mechanical Vibratory System refers to a system designed to handle or produce mechanical vibrations.&lt;SEP&gt;Mechanical Vibratory System involves oscillatory motion, mentioned in the context of control systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The mechanical vibratory system refers to the setup used to analyze vibrations and oscillations in the spring-mass system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-baf80d031591815111410b79dbb30df9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-204404dff5633144a45a65a52892839a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ea5a2f30b2dcfbbb586c6854279bee</data>
