  <data key="d0">Equation (6–5)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Equation (6–5) is part of the mathematical framework used to determine the intersection of asymptotes and the real axis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a89464a87dc57e95afa0a980ba9d6c0</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
