<node id="Graph 1">
  <data key="d0">Graph 1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Graph 1 displays a line graph with a curve that decreases from left to right, with no clear pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph 1 features a single peak at approximately t = 0.5 seconds with a function value around y = 0.02.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph 1 is a plot showing two curves labeled I and II, representing a decaying exponential function with amplitude decreasing as the input signal increases.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph 1 is a sinusoidal pattern graph representing a simple sine wave with time on the x-axis and amplitude on the y-axis.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph 1 represents the function x1 plotted against time, showing a single peak at t=2 and oscillating between -0.15 and 0.15.</data>
