<node id="Orthogonality of Root Loci">
  <data key="d0">Orthogonality of Root Loci</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Orthogonality of Root Loci refers to the concept where the loci of constant gain are circles centered at the origin, and the loci corresponding to specific phase angles lie on the negative real axis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8bb8d79a4bce9c3a0571e1ec2592d1a4</data>
