  <data key="d0">MATLAB Program 6–9</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">MATLAB Program 6–9 is used to obtain unit-step and unit-ramp response curves for compensated and uncompensated systems in a control system analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9fd33644dda3aedeaeec8c353b048358</data>
