<node id="Compensated System (Method 1)">
  <data key="d0">Compensated System (Method 1)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A system designed to respond to unit-step and unit-ramp inputs with quicker response times compared to other systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-61051e4c9ded933a2eced18249deafb1</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Uncompensated System">
  <data key="d0">Uncompensated System</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Uncompensated System is a control system that remains in its original form without any modifications or enhancements, such as compensators or compensation techniques. It serves as a baseline for performance comparison with compensated systems. This system typically exhibits slower response times to unit-step and unit-ramp inputs, higher steady-state errors, and lower stability compared to compensated systems. It is prone to less optimal performance, often displaying higher overshoot and increased oscillations or instability. The Uncompensated System is characterized by its slower reaction and lower output values, making it less desirable in terms of dynamic response and overall performance when compared to systems that have undergone adjustments for improved stability and control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a35e7b410420b5623c1fd33526a3e9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-896487ddef7a3f411006102c6c7a9b2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0948b1e428ea01364b1b1ec1955431f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96a98f812e32e184c15978c0d7771176&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61051e4c9ded933a2eced18249deafb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59498f3e851cf3c70c4395e945e7e809&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfe03dc7efd5be8b8b6f705865273b86&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-486351ecd11a42798affd79b7f5d143b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac56debe5e5db6d5809231139242ca61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ef7861303c3473cd3d47c68848af64d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbeb374a3410f00ce0c005645f04e14&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e6b7d8c1849925b0d0f1ad9793983e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bca6ad29eb261282c2df664425ef7d0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e48cc17fab45352c6a28829079bd2b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7d9a35f388915f791a96d8cdc32529b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1fe4f707d8920dbeac015fecfd158e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f90ff0e91c9dc075f3521e774137ba02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3a55af272f2092fd9d053a8d89af4b4</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
