  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A system designed to respond to unit-step and unit-ramp inputs with moderate response times, faster than the uncompensated system but slower than Method 1.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-61051e4c9ded933a2eced18249deafb1</data>
