  <data key="d2">The graph depicts the unit-step responses of compensated and uncompensated systems, showing variations in overshoot and response time.&lt;SEP&gt;This graph illustrates the unit-step responses of both uncompensated and compensated systems, highlighting differences in their dynamic behaviors.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a35e7b410420b5623c1fd33526a3e9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3a55af272f2092fd9d053a8d89af4b4</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
