  <data key="d0">Chapter 6</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A section of the book or document that details the analysis and design of control systems using the root-locus method.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 6 refers to the section of a textbook or document focused on Control Systems Analysis and Design by the Root-Locus Method.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-610f25557b703d8c29a8efc2d292eb77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb6a1e10709bc450dad65923e1301042</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
