<node id="T2">
  <data key="d0">T2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A variable representing a time constant or parameter in the compensator design.&lt;SEP&gt;T2 is another time constant in the lag-lead compensator, chosen to achieve specific phase conditions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-51ed07bf7b1b56e1246deb3b4a2fd5cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7f571134d683a0689226e17f5c8f12d2</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Beta">
  <data key="d0">Beta</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A factor used in determining the phase-lead network, calculated as 3.503.&lt;SEP&gt;Beta is a parameter in the lag-lead compensator, influencing the placement of poles and zeros.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7f571134d683a0689226e17f5c8f12d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7d2c20fec382eb167929db2080ec8c24</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Phi">
