<node id="Frequency Response Plot">
  <data key="d0">Frequency Response Plot</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A graphical representation of a system's behavior in terms of magnitude and phase angle over a range of frequencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Frequency response plot is a graph showing how the system responds to different frequencies, represented in decibels and radians per second.&lt;SEP&gt;The Frequency Response Plot is a graphical representation that displays the behavior of the system, including decibel values and phase response across frequencies.&lt;SEP&gt;The frequency response plot is a graphical representation of a system's output signal magnitude and phase shift as a function of input frequency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f22851addd0d0d43a22e89bf8e277faf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4c46665e037287407ddbff2463962aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-586f97239ba09b5129d50fc14028adbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-926952abfdc3443e6470e2a990053a6c</data>
