<node id="Space Vehicle">
  <data key="d0">Space Vehicle</data>
  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">A model of a space vehicle is used within the control system to simulate its dynamics and response to inputs.&lt;SEP&gt;Space Vehicle is the plant being controlled within the control system, typically modeled using transfer functions or state-space models.&lt;SEP&gt;The Space Vehicle is part of the control system and is characterized by its transfer function, 1/s^2, indicating a second-order system with a double pole at the origin.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5d0a99065421970bde5dae1689b5a3b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36e714a094e63aef48fac634eeddad6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3054b048b0a72e379da574dd802acf5c</data>
