<node id="Output (Y(s))">
  <data key="d0">Output (Y(s))</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Output represents the result of the interaction between the input, lead compensator, space vehicle, and controller in the control system.&lt;SEP&gt;The actual output of the system, which is fed back to the controller in the block diagram.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a5b3fa9ac1d3ce61d8dbdd21acb60d10&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3054b048b0a72e379da574dd802acf5c</data>
