  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Transfer Function Xo(s)/Xi(s) describes the relationship between input and output in the control system, derived through mathematical equations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3054b048b0a72e379da574dd802acf5c</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Output Response">
  <data key="d0">Output Response</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The output response is the result produced by the control system after processing the input signal through its components.</data>
