  <data key="d0">Lead Portion</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The lead portion of the compensator introduces a zero to improve the transient response of the system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e6b7d8c1849925b0d0f1ad9793983e9</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
