  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Vectors and Trigonometry refer to the mathematical concepts illustrated in the diagram, helping to understand the relationships between angles, magnitudes, and directions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-feb8129fd0acf4bdee571b9fbeafe347</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
