<node id="Circular Root Locus">
  <data key="d0">Circular Root Locus</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Circular Root Locus is a specific pattern in the root-locus plot indicating potential system behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Circular Root Locus is a graphical method used in control systems to analyze the roots of a system's characteristic equation.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-faf6d229bd33d9a677ddb2c4f3fe8552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb6f6f4567355162f36e936387a3dc4</data>
