</node>
<node id="Positive Real Axis">
  <data key="d0">Positive Real Axis</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The positive real axis is part of the real number line used in complex analysis, relevant for determining system behavior.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0b429aa524429e2d3a0bb88587574c34</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Unity-feedback System">
  <data key="d0">Unity-feedback System</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Unity-feedback System is a control system configuration characterized by its feedback loop having a transfer function of unity, or a gain of one. This simplification aids in the analysis and design of the system. It is often employed to achieve desired control characteristics and ensure stability and control by feeding the output back to the input, creating a loop. The system utilizes an open-loop transfer function and is integral to control theory, particularly in analyzing system responses and determining closed-loop frequency responses.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-fc700758bd11889bde17fb78bf15e8bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60969709c0f545814b039c0d77d040ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67cb8477adc7c0ef97482e4e7be7fa4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d46c03f5b1a1f1ab07036c79e47616c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6dd7424b8787a27ad020fa883c295d8b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f86521265de1eaaef568da798d2e3a53</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Mechanical Lag Network">
  <data key="d0">Mechanical Lag Network</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A type of mechanical system that follows changes in input, often used to stabilize system response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f104d09d0c472d244729f4c0273b66e0</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Series Circuit">
  <data key="d0">Series Circuit</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A circuit configuration where components are connected end-to-end, forming a single path for current flow.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f104d09d0c472d244729f4c0273b66e0</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Parallel Circuit">
  <data key="d0">Parallel Circuit</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A circuit configuration where components are connected across the same voltage source, forming multiple paths for current flow.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f104d09d0c472d244729f4c0273b66e0</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Total Resistance">
