</node>
<node id="Unit Step Response">
  <data key="d0">Unit Step Response</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Unit Step Response is an analysis method in control systems showing how a system responds to a sudden change in input.&lt;SEP&gt;The output of a system when a step input is applied, used to analyze system dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;The response of a system to a unit step input, analyzed in the MATLAB program.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f104d09d0c472d244729f4c0273b66e0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-646ed44ca6a37b5351e0aef0dd18547a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0da5e287367d28d325608315c407faa1</data>
