<node id="Controller T(s)">
  <data key="d0">Controller T(s)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The controller in the block diagram is represented by the transfer function T(s) = 1/s (s + K), which processes the input signal to produce a control output.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3c317b9ff2b2110c0c0b14f7d7fbc89c</data>
