<node id="Plant P(s)">
  <data key="d0">Plant P(s)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The plant P(s) is the physical system being controlled, represented by its transfer function in the control system.&lt;SEP&gt;The plant in the block diagram has a transfer function P(s) = s/(s + 1) and generates an output signal based on the control input it receives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3c317b9ff2b2110c0c0b14f7d7fbc89c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60969709c0f545814b039c0d77d040ef</data>
