  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A section in the book 'Control Systems Analysis and Design by the Frequency-Response Method' that discusses frequency-response methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Chapter 7 focuses on Control Systems Analysis and Design by the Frequency-Response Method, providing insights into system stability and design requirements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9e830557547fd0c9d37cbd07da38c0e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a5c8adb826b6a09285fe1ad5b9d9b8c</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
