</node>
<node id="Phase Angle Plot">
  <data key="d0">Phase Angle Plot</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The phase angle plot displays the shift in the phase of the signal with respect to time, indicating phase lead or lag at different frequencies.&lt;SEP&gt;The phase angle plot is part of a Bode plot, showing the phase shift of a system across different frequencies.&lt;SEP&gt;The phase angle plot is part of the Bode diagram that indicates the phase shift introduced by the system at different frequencies.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-855fbfd6cc8ae599aa41c969d6418c33&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f6dad58f78a125a7c454b0f2177f13a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b6f14da320af4579baf89f7ad82028e</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="G(s) Transfer Function">
  <data key="d0">G(s) Transfer Function</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The transfer function G(s) is given by the equation 9(s^2 + 0.2s + 1)/(s(s^2 + 1.2s + 9)), representing the system's frequency response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4f6dad58f78a125a7c454b0f2177f13a</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
