  <data key="d2">A graphical representation of complex numbers, similar to the Cartesian plane, used to plot the real and imaginary parts of complex numbers.&lt;SEP&gt;Argand Diagram is a complex plane representation where Nyquist plots are often visualized, showing real and imaginary components.&lt;SEP&gt;The Argand Diagram is a complex plane used to plot complex numbers, showing the real and imaginary components.&lt;SEP&gt;The Argand Diagram is a graphical representation used to analyze complex numbers, similar to the Nyquist Diagram, by plotting them in the complex plane.</data>
