  <data key="d0">Polar Plots</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Graphs that depict complex functions in polar coordinates, used for analyzing control systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Polar plots are graphical representations of mathematical functions, particularly useful for visualizing complex numbers and their relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;Polar plots are used in control systems to visualize the relationship between gain margin and phase margin.&lt;SEP&gt;Polar plots are used to represent complex functions in terms of magnitude and phase angle.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8c47160042a9398aa709e25eded3b0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2160cb6aaf30b68e3cbc695bfa7548cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c90d44afb796b38b91c19121ba0bf8c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96a98f812e32e184c15978c0d7771176</data>
