  <data key="d2">A Cartesian Coordinate System is a coordinate system that specifies each point uniquely in a plane by a pair of numerical coordinates.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical system for graphing functions using x and y axes, representing real and imaginary components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8c47160042a9398aa709e25eded3b0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8a3a4cd5f5a625120a672d9302619e4</data>
