  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The -1+j0 point is a critical reference point in the Nyquist Stability Criterion, used to determine the stability of a system based on its encirclement by the Nyquist plot.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1fc8172454011b7e111636e450b0431d</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
