  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Frequency-response curves are plots that show how the amplitude and phase of a system's output vary with the frequency of the input signal.&lt;SEP&gt;Frequency-response curves show how the amplitude and phase of a system's output vary with frequency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5518828c63927a29cbd23a5354674537&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fc8172454011b7e111636e450b0431d</data>
