  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Large K refers to a graph with a larger size in the context of stability analysis, indicating system instability due to encirclement of the -1+j0 point.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b780aae2274d6d12811004661f2bb425</data>
