</node>
<node id="Nyquist Locus">
  <data key="d0">Nyquist Locus</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Nyquist locus refers to the plot used in control systems to analyze stability based on frequency response.&lt;SEP&gt;The Nyquist locus is a plot used in control systems to determine stability by examining encirclements of critical points.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a480968a716a749c7646332b8d7dec12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3d1b21ce83b859c71c888d5c7aae6ba</data>
