  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The accuracy and quality of a signal as it is processed through a system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1c56a057e86a61de468030b87f550fa4</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
