  <data key="d0">MATLAB Program 7-12</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">MATLAB Program 7-12 is a script designed to calculate the Bode diagram, resonant peak, resonant frequency, and bandwidth for a given system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0e2d5c8521bc1f35d5a5daaf0b7fe7eb</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
