  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Graph 3">
  <data key="d0">Graph 3</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Graph 3 is a plot of the ratio of the output signal to the input signal against time, featuring two curves labeled I and II, representing exponential decay functions with different shapes.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph 3 presents a line graph with a curve that increases from left to right, with no clear pattern.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph 3 represents the function x3 plotted against time, displaying a single peak at t=1 and oscillating between -1.5 and 1.5.&lt;SEP&gt;Graph 3 starts below y = 0, increases to a maximum slightly above y = 1 at around t = 2 seconds, then decreases again.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bae8df079707c93331cb95e16abe02aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7ee96b6c7a32a3b2a58081228221eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-485e298f6b5c334208195cfaf790e781&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e2d5c8521bc1f35d5a5daaf0b7fe7eb</data>
