  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Controller C(s)">
  <data key="d0">Controller C(s)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The controller C(s) is a component of the control system that processes the error between desired and actual outputs to drive the system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60969709c0f545814b039c0d77d040ef</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Output Signal Y(s)">
  <data key="d0">Output Signal Y(s)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The output signal Y(s) is the final output of the control system after processing by the controller and plant.&lt;SEP&gt;The output signal Y(s) is the final processed signal emerging from the system.&lt;SEP&gt;Y(s) is the final output signal of the system, resulting from the processing stages.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c282b61c2db78468e0d216e25c2dfdb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-60969709c0f545814b039c0d77d040ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0690050aa436f47134092f69ec8ed18b</data>
