<node id="Constant-Magnitude Loci">
  <data key="d0">Constant-Magnitude Loci</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Constant-Magnitude Loci are curves on a plot representing points where the magnitude of the closed-loop frequency response remains constant.&lt;SEP&gt;Constant-Magnitude Loci are graphical curves in control systems representing points of constant magnitude.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-faf6d229bd33d9a677ddb2c4f3fe8552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f86521265de1eaaef568da798d2e3a53</data>
