<node id="Constant-Phase-Angle Loci">
  <data key="d0">Constant-Phase-Angle Loci</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Constant-Phase-Angle Loci are curves on a plot representing points where the phase angle of the closed-loop frequency response remains constant.&lt;SEP&gt;Constant-Phase-Angle Loci, also known as N Circles, represent phase angles in terms of X and Y, involving complex mathematical equations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-68abbb58b262f59e481e8f8f8079891e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f86521265de1eaaef568da798d2e3a53</data>
