<node id="M Circles">
  <data key="d0">M Circles</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">M Circles refer to a family of circles defined by a constant mathematical parameter M, illustrating different mathematical concepts and solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;M Circles represent constant magnitude loci in frequency response analysis, used to determine resonant peak values and other system characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;M circles are geometric representations used to determine the resonant peak magnitude in frequency response analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f7f4ddee3ffc4ad47062df678fff024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68abbb58b262f59e481e8f8f8079891e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-061cf1e0924989ccbea19f388762245a</data>
