<node id="N Circles">
  <data key="d0">N Circles</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">N Circles are constant phase loci in frequency response analysis, aiding in the determination of phase margin and other system characteristics.&lt;SEP&gt;N circles are geometric representations that help find phase angles in closed-loop frequency response analysis.</data>
