<node id="Open-loop System">
  <data key="d0">Open-loop System</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A system where the output does not affect the input, represented by the G(jω) locus in frequency response analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;An open-loop system operates without feedback, characterized by its transfer function G(s).&lt;SEP&gt;The open-loop system refers to a system configuration without feedback, analyzed using Bode diagrams.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f7f4ddee3ffc4ad47062df678fff024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e23c313eaf5a6d348bce8a1588be0f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e67cb8477adc7c0ef97482e4e7be7fa4</data>
