<node id="Corner Frequencies">
  <data key="d0">Corner Frequencies</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Corner Frequencies are specific frequencies in the system where changes in slope occur in the Bode Diagram.&lt;SEP&gt;Corner frequencies are points on the frequency response plot where the slope changes, critical for defining system behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;Corner frequencies are specific frequencies in a control system where the slope of the Bode plot changes, indicating changes in system behavior.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36751d4e3f942193eb2e541b3e4dd23b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4c46665e037287407ddbff2463962aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05bc9bb179b1e6a64609fa853f1c7706</data>
