  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Origin encirclement is a concept in complex analysis involving the tracing of a circle centered at the origin to understand the relationship between a complex number and its polar form.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b1619851fc851316cb57de0ea4fe27f</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
