  <data key="d1">geo</data>
  <data key="d2">The right-half s plane refers to the region in the complex plane where the real part of a complex number is positive, significant in control system stability analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b1619851fc851316cb57de0ea4fe27f</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
