<node id="Proportional Controller (P)">
  <data key="d0">Proportional Controller (P)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Proportional Controller (P) is a type of controller that uses a proportional gain to control system output.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of controller that uses proportional gain to amplify error signals in control systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a12a1fcc8b96ef105600adda81cf5b8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bfe9ed85a05514b41c868536d544660</data>
