</node>
<node id="Proportional-Integral Controller (PI)">
  <data key="d0">Proportional-Integral Controller (PI)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Proportional-Integral Controller (PI) combines proportional and integral actions to enhance system control.&lt;SEP&gt;A controller type that combines proportional and integral actions to improve system response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a12a1fcc8b96ef105600adda81cf5b8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bfe9ed85a05514b41c868536d544660</data>
