  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Proportional-Integral-Derivative Controller (PID) integrates proportional, integral, and derivative actions for precise control.&lt;SEP&gt;A comprehensive controller type that integrates proportional, integral, and derivative actions for precise control.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a12a1fcc8b96ef105600adda81cf5b8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0bfe9ed85a05514b41c868536d544660</data>
