  <data key="d0">Delay Time (L)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Delay time, denoted as L, is a constant characterizing the S-shaped response curve, determined via tangent line analysis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a12a1fcc8b96ef105600adda81cf5b8f</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
