  <data key="d0">Reference Input (r(t))</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Reference Input, denoted as r(t), represents the desired output or setpoint of the system in a control loop.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f67e9b469ce0543584be32ab4c6f89c</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
