  <data key="d0">Control Signal (u(t))</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Control Signal, denoted as u(t), is the output from the controller that is applied to the system to achieve the desired response.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6f67e9b469ce0543584be32ab4c6f89c</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
