  <data key="d0">u(s)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">u(s) is the control output in a control system, adjusted based on the proportional, integral, and derivative components.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f87ef3fd6a4c1856d15e4ad169e98183</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
