  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An equation derived from the control system's transfer function, used to determine system stability and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;The characteristic equation is used to determine the behavior and stability of the minimum-order observer.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-7cb24308be90f4de9c5775f0a3a25ce9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebaafb882dc8bd6dc4ec02a47f1205e2</data>
