  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Linear independence is a property of a set of vectors where no vector can be written as a linear combination of the others.&lt;SEP&gt;Linear independence refers to a set of vectors where no vector can be represented as a linear combination of the others, implying all coefficients in the combination are zero.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-56a514da1cb0f88116234689304bc8d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c5f8bc3750c711a5de6e8037c4fda4c0</data>
