  <data key="d0">Jordan Blocks</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Jordan Blocks are submatrices in the Jordan canonical form, associated with specific eigenvalues, important for observability conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;Jordan blocks are matrix structures used to analyze eigenvalues in control systems, important for determining controllability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36f2caf127ba71d0e038dc68e38f26ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a7e6ee6eefc1562c87e6317d173028b</data>
