  <data key="d0">Control Function u</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The control function u is an input function that affects the state of the system, though it does not impact observability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-817b95a5144d0dce10f2c3a02063acbe</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
