<node id="Matrix">
  <data key="d0">Matrix</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A matrix is a rectangular array of numbers or symbols arranged in rows and columns, used in mathematical computations.&lt;SEP&gt;A matrix is a rectangular array of numbers, symbols, or expressions, arranged in rows and columns, used in mathematics.&lt;SEP&gt;Matrices are used in the text to describe system dynamics and transformations, such as diagonalization.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a025c4295ffa25ee11426c0bff4fb282&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ae5ca3b7a89038d8b6dbc78ab1fcc29&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3799700b8e604e5c5384e0643a874e09</data>
