<node id="System Observability">
  <data key="d0">System Observability</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">System observability is a measure of how well internal states of a system can be inferred from knowledge of its external outputs.&lt;SEP&gt;System observability refers to the ability to determine the state of a system from its outputs. The text discusses conditions for complete observability.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-36f2caf127ba71d0e038dc68e38f26ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65dda872b092acba83b3de464ee4c24b</data>
