  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Care rows refer to the specific rows in a matrix that need to be linearly independent for certain controllability conditions to be met.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8185f3f5e2ea2ff5f1955f91117943ca</data>
