<node id="Observer">
  <data key="d0">Observer</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Observer is a crucial component within control systems, designed to estimate the internal states of a system when these states cannot be directly measured. By utilizing both input and output signals, the Observer provides feedback based on the plant output, which is integral to the control strategy. This estimation of unmeasurable state variables allows the Observer to influence the control system effectively, ensuring that the system operates optimally even when not all state variables can be directly measured. Through its role, the Observer enhances the functionality of the control system by providing accurate estimations that guide the observer controller in making informed decisions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f599210548e4a595268cbd4a1d4b5e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf54b3d3fa835e379c76e3ccf4ecfa3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2591937b2f7c7c5341658076669c1b02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ea5a2f30b2dcfbbb586c6854279bee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681185e57d810ae79c2ee826ac8ba784&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31df32fb8d3f0302ba80571341b33840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94456e2884706eeb42e67b6c40918a79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2db63f41e22678b776f42091570392a</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
