  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Transformation block converts the estimated state from the observer into a form suitable for control purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Transformation refers to converting between different mathematical representations, such as state-space to transfer function.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-76155cfacd298ba99866d06587bc0e7d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caeb6d047b3cd8348a555d68841dee56</data>
