  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A full-order observer is a control system observer that estimates all the states of the system, matching the order of the system.&lt;SEP&gt;The Full-Order Observer estimates all state variables, potentially improving performance when output measurements are noisy.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5ab66ab2ea102011daec41a066d3877c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caeb6d047b3cd8348a555d68841dee56</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
