  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Minimum-Order Observer Design refers to a method for designing observers focusing on measurable and unmeasurable state dynamics, simplifying the procedure by utilizing techniques from full-order state observers.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-040d64011f55ec07f471f024c2b1be29</data>
