  <data key="d0">System 1</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A defined system that includes an observer controller, modeled and analyzed using MATLAB.&lt;SEP&gt;System 1 is a closed-loop system characterized by a Bode plot with a constant magnitude response at low frequencies and a bandwidth of 5 rad/sec.&lt;SEP&gt;System 1 is a closed-loop system with a full-order observer, characterized by its frequency response and noise rejection capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-193a843542d1b083c02404daa115957e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c312026bdfdc649299a1d012330f59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2591937b2f7c7c5341658076669c1b02</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Observer Controller">
  <data key="d0">Observer Controller</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Observer Controller is a crucial component in control systems, responsible for estimating the internal state of a system, particularly the state of a plant, based on its measured outputs. It utilizes observer and feedback gains to regulate system performance and improve system dynamics and stability. By processing output signals, the Observer Controller generates error signals that drive control actions to correct deviations from desired states. This component is integral in generating control signals based on feedback from the observer, ensuring the system performs optimally. The transfer function of the Observer Controller is typically calculated using MATLAB, involving complex matrix operations. Overall, the Observer Controller plays a vital role in maintaining the desired performance and stability of control systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f599210548e4a595268cbd4a1d4b5e3c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c312026bdfdc649299a1d012330f59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23aaf2333ba5ac6c78dcc6d9ef3999d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28ae81c40745842e3e00aecec87aa63f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6c1f27816ba00765df34580fd4352b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31df32fb8d3f0302ba80571341b33840&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7ee96b6c7a32a3b2a58081228221eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-193a843542d1b083c02404daa115957e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b6f2069d9a69517d279f1786974d9e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ab66ab2ea102011daec41a066d3877c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e83e0b0f093a4a5ee928c26cb73ad75</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
