<node id="Structured Uncertainty">
  <data key="d0">Structured Uncertainty</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Structured Uncertainty involves parametric variations in plant dynamics, such as changes in poles and zeros of the transfer function.&lt;SEP&gt;Structured uncertainty refers to parametric variations in plant dynamics, such as variations in poles and zeros of the plant transfer function.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-338b0c8db14460db8abd15b27fa186d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d9cf4a88154292d8f7994b72a870f0</data>
