</node>
<node id="Unstructured Uncertainty">
  <data key="d0">Unstructured Uncertainty</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Unstructured Uncertainty includes frequency-dependent uncertainties, such as high-frequency modes often neglected in modeling plant dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;Unstructured Uncertainty refers to unpredictable variations in system parameters that affect control system performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Unstructured uncertainty includes frequency-dependent uncertainties like high-frequency modes not included in modeling plant dynamics.&lt;SEP&gt;Unstructured uncertainty refers to the unpredictable variations in a system, which can be modeled as multiplicative or additive errors in the system dynamics.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-628acd072f30f988c00d9ed5e372af6c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-338b0c8db14460db8abd15b27fa186d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16d9cf4a88154292d8f7994b72a870f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76155cfacd298ba99866d06587bc0e7d</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
