  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Optimal Regulator Problem involves finding a control vector that transfers the system state to a desired region while minimizing the performance index.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-16d9cf4a88154292d8f7994b72a870f0</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
