  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Uncertain Elements in Plant Dynamics refer to the discrepancies between a system's model and its actual behavior, affecting control system design.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-16d9cf4a88154292d8f7994b72a870f0</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
