  <data key="d0">$H_{\infty}$ Norm</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The $H_{\infty}$ norm measures the largest possible amplification factor of the steady-state response to sinusoidal excitation in control systems.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-338b0c8db14460db8abd15b27fa186d5</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
