  <data key="d0">Small Gain Theorem</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The small gain theorem provides a condition for the stability of a closed-loop system by ensuring the product of the transfer functions is less than one.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-338b0c8db14460db8abd15b27fa186d5</data>
