</node>
<node id="Multiplicative Uncertainty">
  <data key="d0">Multiplicative Uncertainty</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Multiplicative uncertainty is a type of unstructured uncertainty where the true plant dynamics are modeled as the product of the nominal plant dynamics and a perturbation term.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-628acd072f30f988c00d9ed5e372af6c</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Additive Uncertainty">
  <data key="d0">Additive Uncertainty</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Additive uncertainty is a type of unstructured uncertainty where the true plant dynamics are modeled as the sum of the nominal plant dynamics and a perturbation term.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-628acd072f30f988c00d9ed5e372af6c</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Robust Stability">
  <data key="d0">Robust Stability</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Robust stability refers to the ability of a control system to maintain stability in the presence of unstructured uncertainties.&lt;SEP&gt;Robust stability refers to the ability of a control system to maintain stability under a range of conditions or disturbances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-570cd2cd2a847eac2402e00924491700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-628acd072f30f988c00d9ed5e372af6c</data>
  <data key="d4">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</node>
<node id="Robust Performance">
  <data key="d0">Robust Performance</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Robust performance in control systems refers to the ability of a system to maintain desired performance levels despite uncertainties.&lt;SEP&gt;Robust performance indicates the ability of a control system to achieve desired performance levels despite uncertainties or disturbances.&lt;SEP&gt;Robust performance is the ability of a control system to ensure that the output follows the input with minimal error, even in the presence of uncertainties.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-570cd2cd2a847eac2402e00924491700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-431aa652eeb49ebed96997dcdfc7e03d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-628acd072f30f988c00d9ed5e372af6c</data>
