<node id="Cofactor">
  <data key="d0">Cofactor</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Cofactor is a component of a matrix used in calculating determinants and inverses.&lt;SEP&gt;Cofactor is a value derived from the minor, adjusted by a sign based on the position within the matrix.&lt;SEP&gt;Cofactors are elements used in the computation of the adjoint matrix, derived from the minors of the original matrix.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-faf6d229bd33d9a677ddb2c4f3fe8552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-650fe4ece98a68e3b77fbb33b8efcab8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa799608fb083db3887d5b7460525b5b</data>
