<edge source="Plant" target="Controller">
  <data key="d5">71.0</data>
  <data key="d6">The Controller and the Plant work together in a control system to regulate and stabilize performance. The Controller is responsible for generating and managing control signals, which are based on feedback from the Plant. It processes input signals and sends output signals to the Plant, aiming to achieve the desired control behavior. The Plant, upon receiving these input signals from the Controller, processes them to generate the system's output. This output is then fed back to the Controller, completing the feedback loop necessary for system regulation and performance improvement. Through this interaction, the Controller and the Plant collaborate to ensure the system operates efficiently.</data>
  <data key="d7">control feedback, performance enhancement&lt;SEP&gt;feedback control, system regulation&lt;SEP&gt;feedback loop, signal processing&lt;SEP&gt;signal management, control process&lt;SEP&gt;signal processing, system control&lt;SEP&gt;signal processing, system regulation&lt;SEP&gt;system operation, input-output relationship</data>
  <data key="d8">chunk-32e837730a9d05b1df592f0ae66e9fc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2350dc025ef445f345d067152812c1c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a7067d3378c6320f2be99583ea919091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1abf1bd63b798f8e59025a047459778&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-219f7fb5973694e4ed3fc49b9c5d4c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2602a3aebfee4edc08475d0264ce7134&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-caeb6d047b3cd8348a555d68841dee56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12d9f86a0ab5347bed74adfcf7735e09</data>
  <data key="d9">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Plant" target="Sensor">
  <data key="d5">8.0</data>
