  <data key="d5">26.0</data>
  <data key="d6">The PID Controller adjusts the Plant's output to match the Reference Input by minimizing the Error Signal.&lt;SEP&gt;The PID Controller manages the Plant by adjusting control inputs based on the plant's response to input signals.&lt;SEP&gt;The PID controller regulates the output of the plant by adjusting control signals based on feedback.</data>
  <data key="d7">control regulation, feedback mechanism&lt;SEP&gt;control system, stability management&lt;SEP&gt;system control, feedback mechanism</data>
