</edge>
<edge source="Transient Response" target="Second-Order System">
  <data key="d5">17.0</data>
  <data key="d6">The transient response is a key aspect of analyzing second-order systems, indicating how they react to disturbances.&lt;SEP&gt;The transient response of a second-order system can be predicted based on its frequency response parameters.</data>
