<edge source="Block Diagram" target="Control System">
  <data key="d5">131.0</data>
  <data key="d6">Block Diagrams are essential tools for representing Control Systems visually. They provide a clear and simplified illustration of the components, operations, and interactions within a control system. By illustrating the structure, signal flow, and feedback loops, block diagrams facilitate the analysis and design of control systems. These diagrams help in visualizing the connections and interactions between the various elements, making it easier to understand the control system's functionality. Overall, block diagrams serve as a comprehensive visual representation, aiding in the effective analysis and communication of control system dynamics.</data>
