<edge source="G(s)" target="E(s)">
  <data key="d5">16.0</data>
  <data key="d6">E(s) sends the error signal to G(s), which processes it to produce an output in the control system.&lt;SEP&gt;G(s) processes the error signal E(s) to generate control actions that minimize discrepancies between desired and actual outputs.</data>
  <data key="d7">control action, error management&lt;SEP&gt;feedback mechanism, signal processing</data>
