  <data key="d5">22.0</data>
  <data key="d6">A closed-loop system can stabilize an unstable open-loop transfer function, as demonstrated in Example 7–18.&lt;SEP&gt;The Open-loop Transfer Function is modified to create a Closed-loop System for achieving stability.&lt;SEP&gt;The stability of a closed-loop system is determined by analyzing its open-loop transfer function using the Nyquist Criterion.</data>
