<edge source="Proportional Controller" target="Integral Controller">
  <data key="d5">13.0</data>
  <data key="d6">Both controllers are described as part of control system actions, with the Proportional Controller focusing on amplification and the Integral Controller on integration.&lt;SEP&gt;The proportional controller stabilizes the system, while the integral controller reduces steady-state error, both essential for system functionality.</data>
