<edge source="Unit-Ramp Response" target="Compensated System">
  <data key="d5">56.0</data>
  <data key="d6">The Compensated System's unit-ramp response demonstrates several key characteristics when compared to an uncompensated system. During the unit-ramp test, the compensated system consistently outputs higher values, indicating enhanced performance over time. Despite having similar transient characteristics to the uncompensated system, the compensated system exhibits improved stability and accuracy. Additionally, the compensated system's unit-ramp response is characterized by a faster response time, which is evident in the unit-ramp response graph that illustrates its output in reaction to a unit ramp input. This response provides valuable insight into how the compensated system effectively manages a continuously changing input, showcasing its superior capabilities in handling dynamic conditions.</data>
  <data key="d7">performance evaluation, sustained output&lt;SEP&gt;response time, system efficiency&lt;SEP&gt;system behavior, input response&lt;SEP&gt;system evaluation, performance analysis&lt;SEP&gt;system performance, ramp input&lt;SEP&gt;system performance, stability&lt;SEP&gt;transient analysis, response comparison</data>
  <data key="d8">chunk-896487ddef7a3f411006102c6c7a9b2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0948b1e428ea01364b1b1ec1955431f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ed1ff4c236c16a58ee408da4a88effc4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2ddda49062cacf815e40ae9bc8167c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c7d9a35f388915f791a96d8cdc32529b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1fe4f707d8920dbeac015fecfd158e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3a55af272f2092fd9d053a8d89af4b4</data>
  <data key="d9">Markdown_nofigure.md</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Unit-Ramp Response" target="Uncompensated System">
  <data key="d5">22.0</data>
  <data key="d6">The Uncompensated System's unit-ramp response is slower and less optimal, illustrating the need for compensation.&lt;SEP&gt;The uncompensated system outputs lower values compared to the compensated system in the unit-ramp test.&lt;SEP&gt;The uncompensated system's unit-ramp response highlights its slower performance compared to the compensated system.</data>
  <data key="d7">performance evaluation, sustained output&lt;SEP&gt;performance lag, system analysis&lt;SEP&gt;system performance, ramp input</data>
  <data key="d8">chunk-ec1fe4f707d8920dbeac015fecfd158e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-896487ddef7a3f411006102c6c7a9b2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3a55af272f2092fd9d053a8d89af4b4</data>
