<edge source="Unstable System" target="Phase Margin">
  <data key="d5">16.0</data>
  <data key="d6">An unstable system is characterized by a negative phase margin, indicating susceptibility to instability with gain increases.&lt;SEP&gt;Phase margin is negative in an unstable system, indicating instability.</data>
