</edge>
<edge source="Unstable System" target="Gain Margin">
  <data key="d5">15.0</data>
  <data key="d6">An unstable system has a negative gain margin, meaning it cannot handle increases in gain without becoming unstable.&lt;SEP&gt;Gain margin does not exceed unity in an unstable system, leading to instability.</data>
  <data key="d7">system instability, control theory&lt;SEP&gt;system instability, gain sensitivity</data>
  <data key="d8">chunk-2dd6d60316691290acdbc20600569961&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c90d44afb796b38b91c19121ba0bf8c5</data>
