  <data key="d6">The Lead Compensator helps achieve the desired Phase Margin in the control system design.&lt;SEP&gt;The Lead Compensator is designed to increase the Phase Margin to meet stability requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The lead compensator is designed to achieve a phase margin of at least 50 degrees, ensuring system stability.&lt;SEP&gt;The lead compensator is used to adjust the phase margin to meet specific stability requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The lead compensator is used to adjust the phase margin, enhancing system stability.</data>
