<edge source="Lag Compensator" target="Phase Margin">
  <data key="d5">26.0</data>
  <data key="d6">Lag compensator modifies the phase margin to improve system stability.&lt;SEP&gt;The lag compensator affects the phase margin by reducing gain at high frequencies, thus improving stability.&lt;SEP&gt;The lag compensator is used to adjust the phase margin to meet stability requirements while minimizing phase lag.</data>
