<edge source="Gain Margin" target="Stable System">
  <data key="d5">17.0</data>
  <data key="d6">A stable system is identified by having a positive gain margin, which indicates it can tolerate increased gain without becoming unstable.&lt;SEP&gt;Gain margin exceeds unity in a stable system, supporting its stability.</data>
  <data key="d7">system stability, control theory&lt;SEP&gt;system stability, gain tolerance</data>
